<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>“All in His hands“? Then life with purpose moves</l><l>Within the circle of His will, and proves</l><l>It good, acceptable. The hands of man</l><l>Or Satan cannot mar or foil the plan</l><l>Which God ordained—to manifest His Son</l><l>In earthen vessels, to a world undone.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
